    "body": "### Description\n\n\nThe lsp have this error, i check and was an error before, but now come back, i don't know if someone else have the same error, just update and open any astro file to reproduce the error.\n\n`vim.schedule` callback: ...im-lLdIFFE/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:582: RPC[Error] code_name = InternalError, message = \"Request initialize failed with message: The `typescript.tsdk` init option is required. It should point to a directory containing a `typescript.js` or `tsserverlibrary.js` file, such as `node_modules/typescript/lib`.\"\nstack traceback:\n\t[C]: in function 'assert'\n\t...im-lLdIFFE/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:582: in function 'fn'\n\t[string \"vim/_core/editor\"]:273: in function <[string \"vim/_core/editor\"]:272>`",
